{
  "title": "No Response Tonight",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">No Response Tonight</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorny_Passage\" title=\"Thorny Passage\">Thorny Passage</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Dim_Forest\" title=\"Dim Forest\">Dim Forest</a>,&#32;<a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Union_EXP\" title=\"Union EXP\"><img alt=\"Union EXP\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Union EXP.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Union_EXP.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0b/Item_Union_EXP.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240525121935\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 100</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-5\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astrite\" title=\"Astrite\"><img alt=\"Astrite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Astrite.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Astrite.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/16/Item_Astrite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523021541\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 10</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Advanced Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/e/e2/Item_Advanced_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152949\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-4\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advanced_Energy_Core\" title=\"Advanced Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Advanced Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Advanced Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/b/b5/Item_Advanced_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153038\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 6,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<b>No Response Tonight</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Dim_Forest\" title=\"Dim Forest\">Dim Forest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Huanglong\" title=\"Huanglong\">Huanglong</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Investigate the radio on the crate to start the quest</li>\n<li>Investigate the robot</li>\n<li>Use Sensor to investigate surroundings</li>\n<li>Repair the robot\n<ul><li>Find the spare parts</li></ul>\n<ol><li>Follow the trail</li></ol>\n<ul><li>Find the supply pack</li></ul>\n<ol><li>Defeat the Exiles at the base, and pick it up.</li></ol>\n<ul><li>Find the motor</li></ul>\n<ol><li>Complete the <a href=\"/wiki/Shooting_Party\" title=\"Shooting Party\">Shooting Party</a> Quest</li></ol></li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Completing the <a href=\"/wiki/Shooting_Party\" title=\"Shooting Party\">Shooting Party</a> Quest is required.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">You’ve picked up a recording. The wind is howling in your ears, carrying the whispers. Perhaps, the robot nearby holds the key to unravel the continuation of the story.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Investigate the glowing spot on the box)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Broken Radio</dd>\n<dd><b>Broken Radio:</b> (Radio Static)</dd>\n<dd><b>Emotionless Broadcast:</b> Systems Activating... Performing Onboard Analysis... Alert: Leg Components, Not Found. Main Motor Module, Diagnostic... Requesting Shutdown...</dd>\n<dd><b>Antsy Voice:</b> Dang it, still not working. HQ, this is Rabbit 2, over. Rabbit 2 to HQ, do you copy? Over...</dd>\n<dd>There was no response. Only the crackling of static and the sound of your breath can be heard. You wait quietly, and after a long pause, the person's voice emerges from the recording once more.</dd>\n<dd><b>Antsy Voice:</b> Rabbit 2 here, I've attempted multiple radio contacts with HQ and received zero response so far... All I can hear out here is Blu checking itself over and over again, and... the wind.</dd>\n<dd>Another moment of silence. You hear the wind whistling past your ears. The person begins to utter as you were about to lay down the radio, his voice clearly filled with exhaustion.</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> After fighting those TDs for so many years, I never expected to get stuck in this kind of place... Now Blu's busted, can't stand up or walk, let alone carry me back...</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> Home... It's been a while since I went home. I hope my family's still doing okay... It's raining, and the rain won't even give me an answer.</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> Those Exiles, heh, they don't give a darn where your home is. All they care about is how to intercept your comms and steal your motor and power module when you're least suspecting...</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> Best of all, I've been looking for Blu's legs all over the place, and turns out they were snatched by <a href=\"/wiki/Excarat\" title=\"Excarat\">Excarats</a>... Haha...</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> You can't run away from bad luck, I guess. Blu, run another check.</dd>\n<dd><b>Emotionless Broadcast:</b> Systems Activating... Performing Onboard Diagnostic... Alert: Leg Components, Not Found. Main Motor Module, Malfunctioning... Requesting Shutdown...</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> Don't you fall asleep on me just yet, old pal. You're the only chat buddy I have right now.</dd>\n<dd><b>Exhausted Voice:</b> ... *sigh* Time to go find that motor of yours. You stay awake no matter what, all right?</dd>\n<dd>Static, it's all you could hear afterward until the radio grew completely silent.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> The robot mentioned in the recording... That must be it. I should go check it out.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Investigate the Robot)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Investigate</dd>\n<dd><b>Broken Robot:</b> Systems Activating... Serial No. 72, Type XV, Combat Piloted Autonomous Droid - Huanglong. Performing Onboard Diagnostic: Number 1,783...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What happened to this place?</dd>\n<dd><b>Broken Robot:</b> Error. Missing Critical Components: Leg Components. Main Motor Module. Auxiliary Power Unit... Requesting Shutdown...</dd>\n<dd><b>Broken Robot:</b> Request Denied. Detected last known order from Operator: \"You have to stay awake no matter what\". Executing Orders: Performing Onboard Diagnostic...</dd>\n<dd><b>Broken Robot:</b> Systems Activating... Serial No. 72, Type XV, Combat Piloted Autonomous Droid. Performing Onboard Diagnostic: Number 1,783...</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> It's on a loop. Guess I'll have to get it fixed up first... Let's see if I can find anything nearby.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After you use the <a href=\"/wiki/Sensor\" title=\"Sensor\">Sensor</a> gadget)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Excarats traces. I should follow it.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> A communications device... Exiles seem to have intercepted its signal. I may be able to find a similar device in the Exile camp nearby.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> I could probably backtrack this device to their hideout. Let's get it a go.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> I can check out the operator's recording again, in case I missed anything.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Go to the device)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Hack</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Found it. It's not too far away. I should check it out.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After following the Excarat traces)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Dig</dd>\n<dd><b>???:</b> *squeak* ... *squeaking angrily* ...!!!</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Excarat! What are they so mad about? No choice but to take them out!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(After defeating the Excarats)</dt>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> That's the last of them. What else do they have hiding in their holes?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Dig</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> More parts for the robot.</dd>\n<dt>(Obtain <span class=\"new\" title=\"Robot Spare Parts (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9ib3RfU3BhcmVfUGFydHM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Robot Spare Parts</span> x1)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Defeat the exiles, and go to the glowing blue spot)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Pick</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> This must be the right one for the robot.</dd>\n<dd><b>Rover:</b> Only the Main Moter left to go. I should search the area again.</dd>\n<dt>(Obtain <span class=\"new\" title=\"Robot Battery Pack (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9ib3RfQmF0dGVyeV9QYWNrP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Robot Battery Pack</span> x1)</dt></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Check the table with the Strange Flyer)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Strange Flyer</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> You There! Wanna blow off some steam?</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> And You! Wanna put your limits to the test?</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> What About You! Wanna gain some fame and earn some bucks while you're at it?</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> Yes! You! The one reading this flyer!</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> At 2:00p.m. tomorrow, we will be hosting a grand tournament slash party at this location. Guess Who's invited?</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> You!</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> Prove to yourself that you have what it takes to be a real badass.</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> Join us and show off your sharpshooting skills!</dd>\n<dd><b>Strange Flyer:</b> Best of all, a mysterious prize awaits!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Go back to the robot)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" /></span></span> Repair</dd>\n<dt>(Submit <span class=\"new\" title=\"Robot Spare Parts (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9ib3RfU3BhcmVfUGFydHM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Robot Spare Parts</span> x1, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Robot Battery Pack (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9ib3RfQmF0dGVyeV9QYWNrP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Robot Battery Pack</span> x1, <span class=\"new\" title=\"Robot Engine (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvUm9ib3RfRW5naW5lP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Robot Engine</span> x1)</dt>\n<dd><b>Repaired Robot:</b> Systems Activating... Serial No. 72, Type XV, Combat Piloted Autonomous Droid - Huanglong. Performing Onboard Diagnostic, Number 2,003...</dd>\n<dd><b>Repaired Robot:</b> Main Motor, Normal. Power Module, Normal. All Functions, Normal...</dd>\n<dd><b>Repaired Robot:</b> Systems Activated. Confirming Mission Orders...</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Whis is your name?</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> What happened to this place?</dd>\n<dd><b>Repaired Robot:</b> Serial No. 72, Type XV, Combat Piloted Autonomous Droid - Huanglong. You may call me Blu.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> Records indicate Blue and its operator were massively outnumbered during a Tacet Discord conflict. A retreat order was issued by the operator.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> With the operator onboard, Blue encountered malfunctions of missing leg components and the main motor, causing Blue to become stranded at this location.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> My orders are to remain active and await the operator's return. Repeat, My orders are to remain active.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> He will return.\n<dl><dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> My orders are to remain active and await the operator's return. Repeat, My orders are to remain active.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> He won't return.\n<dl><dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> ...Orders confirmed. Priority Mission Set: Await for the operator's return. Blu will remain active.</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> Rover, thank you for helping me find my missing components. I shall now proceed with my mission.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> Here are some supplies. The Operator once issued the order of \"All favors must be returned\". As I have detected you have assisted me, then I must offer gratitude.</dd>\n<dd><b>\"Blu\":</b> Rest assured, these are unused and left by the operator. Please accept them.</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Emoji EN Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"Emoji_EN_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/f/f5/Emoji_EN_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/19?cb=20240529221541\" /></span></span></span>&#160;&#160;English</b></td><td>No Response Tonight</td></tr><tr><td style=\"line-height:1em\"><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji ZHS Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAA